    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Total Defense: Three Kingdoms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Total Defense: Three Kingdoms</i> is an immersive strategic tower defense game centered on the legendary tales of Shu-Han. As a battlefield commander, you\u2019ll wield iconic defense towers incarnated by heroes like Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhao Yun across 32 epic campaigns\u2014from the Oath of the Peach Garden to the Battle of Yiling. Forge your ultimate defense matrix through a unique fusion of <strong>card-enhanced</strong> <strong>tactics</strong> and <strong>talent tree progression</strong>: unleash Guan Yu\u2019s devastating critical strikes, summon Kong Ming\u2019s celestial firestorms to decimate legions, and witness the Three Kingdoms\u2019 chaos unfold like a living watercolor scroll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Heroic Towers</strong> \u00b7 Legends as Fortifications</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine Unique Hero Towers</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Guan Yu Tower</strong>: High critical hit chance + critical damage boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Zhao Yun Tower</strong>: Mastery in dodging + piercing attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Kong Ming Tower</strong>: Devastating Elemental assaults</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Ma Chao Tower</strong>: Doubled defensive efficiency</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historically Inspired Skills</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Awe Across Nations</strong>: Annihilates all on-screen enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Roar</strong> of Fury: Terrifies foes with area-wide debuffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>East Wind</strong>: Transforms enemy projectiles into harmless rain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Green Medical</strong>: Restores tower health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Cards \u00d7 Talents</strong> \u00b7 Infinite Strategic Depth</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Card Types</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Attribute Cards</strong>: Permanently boost tower stats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Skill Cards</strong>: Unlock legendary abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Enhancement Cards</strong>: Upgrade existing skills </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Kismet Cards</strong>: Trigger unexpected effects </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-Dimensional Progression</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Leveling System</strong>: Earn XP to gain new levels and passive bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Talent Tree</strong>: Customize tower evolution paths via talent points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Gold Economy</strong>: Spend battle-earned gold to purchase cards and unlock elite skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Dynamic Warfare</strong> \u00b7 Outsmart the Horde</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit &amp; Skill Mechanics</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\tCavalry excel at raids but are forced into detours by <strong>fortification</strong> barriers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Army Breaker</strong> skill not only cleaves enemies but deflects attacks such as fireballs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o Use\u00a0<strong>Flowerfall</strong> skill to blast enemies away</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable Difficulty</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Easy Mode</strong>: Weaken enemy waves + auto-supply</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Active Enemy Cap</strong>: Adjust enemy army scale </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Nightmare Mode</strong>: Enhanced enemy waves + resource caps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tagline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Five Tiger Generals as towers, Thirty-Six Stratagems as cards! Forge your legend in the ink-stained battlefields of the Three Kingdoms!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Total Defense: Three Kingdoms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Total Defense: Three Kingdoms</i> is an immersive strategic tower defense game centered on the legendary tales of Shu-Han. As a battlefield commander, you\u2019ll wield iconic defense towers incarnated by heroes like Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhao Yun across 32 epic campaigns\u2014from the Oath of the Peach Garden to the Battle of Yiling. Forge your ultimate defense matrix through a unique fusion of <strong>card-enhanced</strong> <strong>tactics</strong> and <strong>talent tree progression</strong>: unleash Guan Yu\u2019s devastating critical strikes, summon Kong Ming\u2019s celestial firestorms to decimate legions, and witness the Three Kingdoms\u2019 chaos unfold like a living watercolor scroll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 <strong>Heroic Towers</strong> \u00b7 Legends as Fortifications</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine Unique Hero Towers</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Guan Yu Tower</strong>: High critical hit chance + critical damage boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Zhao Yun Tower</strong>: Mastery in dodging + piercing attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Kong Ming Tower</strong>: Devastating Elemental assaults</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Ma Chao Tower</strong>: Doubled defensive efficiency</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historically Inspired Skills</strong>:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Awe Across Nations</strong>: Annihilates all on-screen enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Roar</strong> of Fury: Terrifies foes with area-wide debuffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>East Wind</stron