 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Easy Mode</strong>: Weaken enemy waves + auto-supply</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Active Enemy Cap</strong>: Adjust enemy army scale </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0o\t<strong>Nightmare Mode</strong>: Enhanced enemy waves + resource caps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tagline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Five Tiger Generals as towers, Thirty-Six Stratagems as cards! Forge your legend in the ink-stained battlefields of the Three Kingdoms!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
